{
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "ADP-ADS-PILOT",
      "title": "pilot: omni-plc-sim ADS (TwinCAT 3 IPC, AMS port 851) -> ads adapter (symbol upload + sum read) -> file",
      "intent": "The first case on a real ADS/AMS server. If it fails, SFC's ads adapter can no longer read a TwinCAT 3 PLC: it frames AMS/TCP by the declared length, uploads the symbol table (Read 0xF00F for nSymSize, then Read 0xF00B for 113 TwinCAT 3 entries with type GUIDs, which it must walk by entryLength) and reads its 54 channels with one sum read (ReadWrite 0xF080) per cycle, in all three deployment modes. Static values of every type it decodes, the arrays and the TwinCAT system structs arrive exact; the dynamic signals stay in range and change over 8 records (the first read waits out the TCP client's 1 s first send, so the second follows it back to back; reads 2-8 are seven samples 200 ms apart); the simulator's request log proves the wire plan and that no item failed. The channel set avoids the client defects known today: TIME_OF_DAY decoded as seconds (Decoder.kt:106-109), DT/TOD type names and LWORD (unmapped, DataType.kt:39-69), DATE/DT after 2038 and TIME from 2^31 ms (signed, Decoder.kt:90-128), dcTaskTime (1970 epoch), non-ASCII STRING/WSTRING (Decoder.kt:64-74), negative array bounds (GetSymbolsResponse.kt:100-101), member paths (AdsSource.kt:64), structs, enums and function blocks (raw bytes), POINTER TO (DataType.kt:39), ULINT from 2^53 (JsonHelper.kt:78), NaN, PLC restarts (TcpClient.kt:277-301 misses the FIN), a second device or source on the same host (AdsSource.kt:170), NetIds with leading zeros (RequestResponse.kt:43) and more than 500 channels (sum reads are never split).",
      "pins": [
        "adapters/ads/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/ads/protocol/Client.kt:32-48",
        "adapters/ads/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/ads/protocol/Client.kt:133-162",
        "adapters/ads/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/ads/protocol/RequestResponse.kt:84-102",
        "adapters/ads/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/ads/protocol/GetSymbolsLengthResponse.kt:18-22",
        "adapters/ads/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/ads/protocol/GetSymbolsResponse.kt:19-65",
        "adapters/ads/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/ads/protocol/MultiReadRequest.kt:27-59",
        "adapters/ads/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/ads/protocol/MultiReadResponse.kt:34-111",
        "adapters/ads/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/ads/protocol/DataType.kt:39-69",
        "adapters/ads/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/ads/protocol/Decoder.kt:84-128",
        "core/sfc-core/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/data/JsonHelper.kt:74-149",
        "core/sfc-core/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/data/SourcesValuesAsFlow.kt:133-146",
        "core/sfc-core/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/tcp/TcpClient.kt:256-260"
      ],
      "tier": "local-infra",
      "priority": "P1",
      "services": [
